# arcus-arb Phase A environment / Phase A 环境变量
#
# No environment variables or secrets are required for:
#
#   python3 main.py --symbol SNDK --hedge lighter-rh --record-only
#
# Arcus Phase A uses public market discovery and public market-data websocket
# subscriptions only. Do not add Arcus private keys or signing material here.
# This file is retained as a clear, empty template for later phases; `.env`
# itself remains ignored by Git.
